{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon arriving in Brighthaven, you inherit your late uncle\u2019s bankrupt delivery company. With only empty warehouses at your disposal, you decide to reinvent the space as a chain of <strong>Rage Rooms</strong>, where people can smash objects to relieve stress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build, manage, and grow</strong> your empire of destruction therapy. Hire staff, upgrade your rooms, and help your clients unwind\u2014one broken plate at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a Manager :</strong> Recruit a team, manage salaries, and develop skills to optimize the operation of your rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Empire :</strong> Invest your profits to expand your premises, acquire new branches, unlock new rooms, and offer ever more surprising objects to destroy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy :</strong> Manage your finances, launch marketing campaigns, and make business decisions to attract a diverse clientele and grow your company.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Customization :</strong> Design your own &quot;Rage Rooms&quot; to meet your clients' desires, maximize their satisfaction\u2026 and your profits!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share Your Creations :</strong> Share your rooms with other players via the workshop!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From the Developer :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Smash Simulator is my first game. I plan to work on it until it is perfect in my eyes, and especially in the eyes of the community.&quot;</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831050?t=1772718199","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati