rong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a Manager :</strong> Recruit a team, manage salaries, and develop skills to optimize the operation of your rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Empire :</strong> Invest your profits to expand your premises, acquire new branches, unlock new rooms, and offer ever more surprising objects to destroy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy :</strong> Manage your finances, launch marketing campaigns, and make business decisions to attract a diverse clientele and grow your company.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Customization :</strong> Design your own &quot;Rage Rooms&quot; to meet your clients' desires, maximize their satisfaction\u2026 and your profits!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share Your Creations :</strong> Share your rooms with other players via the workshop!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From the Developer :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Smash Simulator is my first game. I plan to work on it until it is perfect in my eyes, and especially in the eyes of the community.&quot;</i></p>","developers":["BpDevWorkshop"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831050/abd3f2a25b0165b6409d2929540b0c4d6f53dd81/header.jpg?t=1772718199","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3831050/1150133768/0c06eaa956e7d2450543e7c54b0042cec9fce924/1758897246/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772718198","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3831050/1150133768/0c06eaa956e7d2450543e7c54b0042cec9fce924/1758897246/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772718198","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3831050/11501337